.TH okf-jawn-discard_draft 1  "discard_draft " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-discard_draft \- Remove the caller\*(Aqs own draft without changing committed content.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn discard_draft\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove the caller\*(Aqs own draft without changing committed content.
.SH OPTIONS
